    "body": "Sorry, I was very confused. Maybe I am still waking up.\r\n\r\nYou're right that type=\"context\" is usable per spec for more than just context menus. However, that doesn't appear to be implemented anywhere, last I checked. Removing that is tracked in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/237.",
